[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 424.629, "timestamp": "00:07:04", "text": "这东西叫什么？ 是墨西哥卷饼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 432.79, "timestamp": "00:07:12", "text": "这是墨西哥卷饼。 我有一个麦克风。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 435.83, "timestamp": "00:07:15", "text": "今天戴着麦克风，所以人们会看到我，然后说：“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 438.55, "timestamp": "00:07:18", "text": "这家伙在拍视频博客什么的。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 443.43, "timestamp": "00:07:23", "text": "和这个女孩一起直播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 445.67, "timestamp": "00:07:25", "text": "了解我的人都知道，如果有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 448.39, "timestamp": "00:07:28", "text": "问我“你在直播吗？”，我会说“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 452.469, "timestamp": "00:07:32", "text": "嘿，我是个油管"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 455.35, "timestamp": "00:07:35", "text": "博主”之类的。这样很容易"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 464.55, "timestamp": "00:07:44", "text": "太贵了。可悲的是，我身上没"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 468.23, "timestamp": "00:07:48", "text": "现金。如果能用Pay之类的支付方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 471.589, "timestamp": "00:07:51", "text": "就好了。 我真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 474.469, "timestamp": "00:07:54", "text": "可以把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 479.99, "timestamp": "00:07:59", "text": "所有东西都买下来塞满。 我想把所有东西都试一遍。"}]